{"step_index":712,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T23:59:14Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-23T08:59:14+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-23T08:59:17+09:00\nThe search for \"\"오픈와이즈\" \"하단동\" OR \"낙동대로 542\" 사업자등록번호\" returned the following summary:\n검색하신 \"오픈와이즈\"와 \"하단동\" 또는 \"낙동대로 542\"라는 주소를 조합하여 확인한 결과, 해당 주소지에 위치한 \"오픈와이즈\"라는 업체의 사업자등록번호에 대한 직접적인 정보는 확인되지 않습니다[1][2][3].\n\n참고로, 과거 IT 분야 스타트업으로 언급된 \"오픈와이즈\"[2][3]는 존재했으나, 문의하신 특정 주소지(부산 하단동 낙동대로 542)와의 연관성이나 현재 해당 사업자의 등록 정보는 공개된 자료에서 찾을 수 없습니다[1][4].\n\n정확한 사업자등록번호 확인이 필요하시다면, **국세청 홈택스(사업자등록상태조회)** 또는 **공정거래위원회(통신판매사업자 조회)** 사이트에서 상호명 또는 사업자등록번호를 통해 직접 조회하시는 것을 권장합니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [nicebizinfo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEieQrAm7QOLqtuEMOeAe92IMW00OeEAqxDflp4B-t3OtIg5LVNxrRo5fcSY6m8ftG_pBqU3B-TKYxvHwn-mCKyFqmO3MjbBsKKCuEQ2SYZIEJ7mr5nio0gzRK-omQ7naO86KAOC9dPVkoF5qN-GVNh-3KW)\n[2] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFXiaW4Z9nVUBVunU23Ru1aEFNIXYB1w_gT24SLaZ2PQUgOW1Xcm5mekANyCJzrvHCM7Nw9P8jhsUbdNjUbYcpnAAZX3yg86yJZn29zUCZBgu0X-ew=)\n[3] [rssing.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKbQw5jXWAVYZkXIelw9ePSfrM7JUiihwNQk-eMsnndYhFyl_Q1medAKdGjRndCMfeR3Rh254Ks4CPpe7IzXgn3CW9NBlsxG2Z4Bu_dP9CIIQ4fL12NkghkCACSAxzFEhRdONU1TBs29UR)\n[4] [hankyung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4tnOmIrCMZ5wi5UasIIz_dxRgXAF7wAF7dGDD0R-FrDdMSPGP_ACfFog9Zh0Fz6NX9puDHBtb7rkq12NJIudvoRs-4mUvviX6HbTwMucQHMtI1omuO65_k6weCsQbOO5DSQdB)"}
{"step_index":713,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T23:59:22Z","thinking":"Exploring other Excel/CSV files in \"Desktop/Today\" to see if the required information is present. \"Desktop/Today\" contains numerous previous field survey files, with filenames such as \"(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_배현명_1000행_556이슈완전해결_최종완벽본.xlsx\", \"(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.xlsx\", and \"배현명_실사DB_검증완료_최신.csv\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nconst targetNames = ['오픈와이즈', '인디페이퍼', '사직지국', '대명기획', '지플러스디자인', '우둥불', '삼수니', '그린토이나라', '규성애드', '씨오에스피'];\n\nasync function searchInOldFiles() {\n  const dir = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today';\n  const files = fs.readdirSync(dir);\n\n  for (const f of files) {\n    if (!f.endsWith('.csv') && !f.endsWith('.xlsx')) continue;\n    if (f.startsWith('~$')) continue;\n\n    const fullPath = dir + '/' + f;\n    try {\n      if (f.endsWith('.csv')) {\n        const text = fs.readFileSync(fullPath, 'utf8');\n        targetNames.forEach(tn => {\n          if (text.includes(tn)) {\n            const lines = text.split('\\n');\n            lines.forEach((l, lIdx) => {\n              if (l.includes(tn)) {\n                console.log(`[CSV ${f} Line ${lIdx+1}] ${l.trim().substring(0, 120)}`);\n              }\n            });\n          }\n        });\n      } else if (f.endsWith('.xlsx') && f.includes('배현명') && !f.includes('1000')) {\n        const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n        await wb.xlsx.readFile(fullPath);\n        wb.worksheets.forEach(ws => {\n          ws.eachRow((r, rNum) => {\n            const rowStr = JSON.stringify(r.values);\n            targetNames.forEach(tn => {\n              if (rowStr.includes(tn)) {\n                console.log(`[XLSX ${f} | ${ws.name} R${rNum}] ${rowStr.substring(0, 120)}`);\n              }\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      }\n    } catch(e) {\n      // ignore\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nsearchInOldFiles().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Search target company names in old Desktop files","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\search_old_files.js","toolAction":"Searching old files","toolSummary":"Create search_old_files.js"}}]}
