{"step_index":731,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:00:14Z","thinking":"The provided CSV file contains incomplete business registration numbers. It appears the initial data from Busan IT Industry Promotion Agency/Cretop included complete numbers. Verification shows missing digits in multiple entries: '인디페이퍼' (518-93-), '부산일보 사직지국' (606-06-85), '우둥불' (602-08-4), '삼수니 다락방' (617-21-98), and '그린토이나라' (603-). This suggests a data truncation issue in the current file compared to the original source.\n\n\nFurther examination reveals additional data quality issues. Business registration numbers are incomplete in the source data, but some were successfully recovered through external verification. The \"closure date\" field contains \"휴업자\" (suspended) instead of a date for several companies; these should be moved to the notes field as per data standards. Also, employee count entries containing parenthetical information (e.g., \"71(연구소10명포함)\") require separate handling, placing the numerical value in the employee count column and the parenthetical remark in the notes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nfunction parseFullCSV(content) {\n  const rows = [];\n  let currentRow = [];\n  let currentField = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < content.length; i++) {\n    const char = content[i];\n    const nextChar = content[i + 1];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && nextChar === '\"') {\n        currentField += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      currentField = '';\n    } else if ((char === '\\r' || char === '\\n') && !inQuotes) {\n      if (char === '\\r' && nextChar === '\\n') i++;\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n      currentRow = [];\n      currentField = '';\n    } else {\n      currentField += char;\n    }\n  }\n  if (currentField !== '' || currentRow.length > 0) {\n    currentRow.push(currentField);\n    if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n  }\n  return rows;\n}\n\nconst csvPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.csv';\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(csvPath, 'utf8');\nconst cleanContent = content.charCodeAt(0) === 0xFEFF ? content.slice(1) : content;\nconst rows = parseFullCSV(cleanContent);\nconst data = rows.slice(1);\n\nconst bizMap = {};\ndata.forEach((r, idx) => {\n  const biz = r[3] ? r[3].replace(/-/g, '').trim() : '';\n  if (biz && biz.length === 10) {\n    if (!bizMap[biz]) bizMap[biz] = [];\n    bizMap[biz].push({ rowNum: idx + 2, seq: r[1], name: r[2], cat: r[11], s24: r[16], s25: r[17], note: r[14] });\n  }\n});\n\nconst dups = Object.entries(bizMap).filter(([b, list]) => list.length > 1);\nconsole.log(`Total duplicate biz groups: ${dups.length}`);\ndups.forEach(([b, list], idx) => {\n  console.log(`\\n[Group ${idx + 1}] Biz: ${b}`);\n  list.forEach(item => {\n    console.log(`  Row ${item.rowNum} (Seq ${item.seq}) ${item.name} | Cat: ${item.cat} | S24: ${item.s24} | S25: ${item.s25} | Note: ${item.note}`);\n  });\n});\n","Description":"Analyze duplicate business numbers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\analyze_biz_duplicates.js","toolAction":"Writing duplicate biz analyzer","toolSummary":"Create analyze_biz_duplicates.js"}}]}
